{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓星李鍾碩主演的串流劇《再婚皇后》最近公開，劇集創下韓國原創劇集在該平台的最高播放紀錄，而李鍾碩近日被爆身家驚人，影片頻道「wander planet」透露李鍾碩於2015年3月以43億韓圜（約2,481萬港元）首次購入位於首爾龍山區漢南洞</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.658347+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:02:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.769706+00:00","content_hash":"bb7397a787a4239ae5a01a0c38a0c2cf4e1dcbd5b93a7a45513d5f37c12952c0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}